translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_fd382150:

    # "There is a mountainous presence in the middle of the chamber that you can't ignore."
    "大厅中央有个山岳般的存在，令人无法忽视。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_bfeac4c7:

    # "Sensing your presence, the creature whips its head at you."
    "感应到你的存在，那生物猛地转头看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_0e31d1db:

    # "It charges and slams into an invisible wall. After calming down from fear, you examine the area around the minotaur closer."
    "它冲过来，狠狠撞上一堵无形的墙。你平复恐惧后，更仔细地观察弥诺陶洛斯周围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_ac96bb8e:

    # "There seems to be a runic zone that keeps the creature in."
    "似乎有一片符文区域将那生物困在其中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_23e2bd0a:

    # "Unable to grab you, the minotaur roars. The chamber trembles but you hear no sound. The imprisonment runes appear to keep the sound inside the zone as well."
    "抓不到你，弥诺陶洛斯发出咆哮。洞窟在震颤，你却听不见任何声音。禁锢符文似乎也把声音封在了区域之内。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_8be81dba:

    # "The minotaur grunts and seems to withers slightly. You believe it grumbled something but due to the runic prison, you can't hear anything."
    "弥诺陶洛斯低声哼叫，似乎稍微萎缩了些。你觉得它咕哝了些什么，但由于符文牢笼，什么也听不见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_20981a5b:

    # "In any case, you remember your mission. It is to draw the Minotaur's essence."
    "无论如何，你想起了自己的任务：抽取弥诺陶洛斯的精华。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_149981ed:

    # "The first step will be to take down the runic prison to approach the minotaur."
    "第一步是解除符文牢笼，才能接近弥诺陶洛斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_fff86c10:

    # "That will mean exposing yourself to its aggression. You do not like the prospect of that but for the mission, you steel yourself."
    "那意味着你得暴露在它的攻击之下。你并不喜欢这个前景，但为了任务，还是做好了心理准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_8f341e14:

    # "You look at the sandstone... it seems to be made of sand... and stone, no... you've heard it's actually silicates."
    "你端详着砂岩……它似乎由沙子……和石头组成，不对……你听说它其实是硅酸盐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_daedc7b0:

    # "A small sand pyramid, there's nothing out of the ordinary except that it is horizontally symmetric."
    "一座小小的沙金字塔，除了呈水平对称外，没什么特别之处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_5271b538:

    # "Some pebbles on the ground, and grasses. shouldn't be too common outside of the cave."
    "地上有些鹅卵石和野草。在洞外，这种景象应该不太常见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_44ccf1ff:

    # "The surface of this rock is pretty flat, maybe you can balance the statue on it..."
    "石头表面相当平整，也许你可以把雕像稳稳放在上面……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_f6a6d3dc:

    # "The rock looks flat, and there is a minotaur symbol at the center."
    "这块石头看起来很平整，中央还有一个弥诺陶洛斯的标志。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_54c204c9:

    # "You look at the Minotaur... he seems to be imprisoned in the magical bind."
    "你看向弥诺陶洛斯……他似乎被困在魔法束缚之中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_43f5fdd6:

    # "He seems to sense your scent in front of you. Suddenly, the binds snapped and detached from the wall."
    "他似乎闻到了你的气息。突然，束缚啪的一声断裂，从墙上脱落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_15b3a682:

    # "The magically barrier reappear before your eyes, you cannot escape now..."
    "魔法屏障在你眼前再次出现，你现在逃不掉了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_66fdc36f:

    # "The minotaur stares at you... angrily. He holds the binds in front of you."
    "弥诺陶洛斯怒气冲冲地盯着你……他把镣铐拿到你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_f82219a7:

    # mn "M-master...?"
    mn "主、主人……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_0b98a90b:

    # "You don't know what he is talking about... you stands here, readying your weapon."
    "你不知道他在说什么……只能站在原地，准备好武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_55948bf0:

    # "This only made the minotaur more angry..."
    "这反而让弥诺陶洛斯更加愤怒……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_9b1c37d1:

    # "As the five gems are activated, the magical barrier soon ceases its light in front of you."
    "五块宝石被激活后，面前的魔法屏障很快便失去了光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_48cef365:

    # "A strong barrier barricading you from the minotaur inside..."
    "一道坚固的屏障将你与里面的弥诺陶洛斯隔开……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_7e06c097:

    # "It seems to be controlled by the gems scattered at different section of the cave, maybe you need to activate them first."
    "这道屏障似乎由散落在洞穴各处的宝石控制，或许你得先激活它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_15d1e84b:

    # "You look at the tiny statue of a minotaur, it seems to be flexing its muscles."
    "你看着那座小小的弥诺陶洛斯雕像，它似乎正在绷紧肌肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_a5d17ee1:

    # "You try to pull it out of the crater on the ground, but it seems to be stuck."
    "你试着把它从地上的坑洞里拉出来，但它似乎卡住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_58ede9c2:

    # "Maybe it's not to be moved..."
    "看来它是无法移动的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_e829715d:

    # "You look at the tiny statue of a minotaur, it seems to be flexing its muscles towards its right."
    "你看着那座小小的弥诺陶洛斯雕像，它似乎正朝自己的右侧绷紧肌肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_3c33322e:

    # "As soon as you touch the gem. It instantly convulses."
    "你一碰宝石，它便立刻剧烈震颤起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_961543e3:

    # "The gem seems to react to your placement of statue."
    "宝石似乎对你摆放雕像的位置产生了反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_0623b869:

    # "In a few seconds, the gem glows in bright red."
    "几秒钟后，宝石发出鲜亮的红光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_fa906442:

    # "You can tell that the barrier at the center of the cave has been weakened."
    "你看得出来，洞穴中央的屏障已经减弱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_a56475d2:

    # "There is a red gem on the pillar, it seems to be emanating dim light."
    "石柱上有一块红色宝石，似乎正散发着微弱的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_ace51061:

    # "You feel like you need to do something here to make it glow."
    "你感觉自己需要在这里做些什么，才能让它发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_10fdf7b1:

    # "It comes to you that... maybe there's something to do with the statue."
    "你忽然想到……或许可以从那座雕像入手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_254481de:

    # "The balance... must be restored. You begin to think how you can fill in the craters."
    "平衡……必须恢复。你开始思考该如何填满这些坑洞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_599b6e8e:

    # "The gem is glowing in bright red. You feel that this zone has been completed."
    "宝石正发出鲜亮的红光。你感觉这片区域已经完成了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_3c33322e_1:

    # "As soon as you touch the gem. It instantly convulses."
    "你一碰宝石，它便立刻剧烈震颤起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_961543e3_1:

    # "The gem seems to react to your placement of statue."
    "宝石似乎对你摆放雕像的位置产生了反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_cde638ff:

    # "In a few seconds, the gem glows in bright blue."
    "几秒钟后，宝石发出鲜亮的蓝光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_fa906442_1:

    # "You can tell that the barrier at the center of the cave has been weakened."
    "你看得出来，洞穴中央的屏障已经减弱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_2f64806d:

    # "There is a blue gem on the pillar, it seems to be emanating dim light."
    "石柱上有一块蓝色宝石，似乎正散发着微弱的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_ace51061_1:

    # "You feel like you need to do something here to make it glow."
    "你感觉需要在这里做些什么，才能让它发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_3c33322e_2:

    # "As soon as you touch the gem. It instantly convulses."
    "你一碰宝石，它便立刻剧烈颤动起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_e9d7b9b7:

    # "The gem seems to react to your battle with the statues."
    "宝石似乎对你与雕像的战斗有所反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_32ea40df:

    # "In a few seconds, the gem glows in bright green."
    "几秒后，宝石绽放出明亮的绿光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_fa906442_2:

    # "You can tell that the barrier at the center of the cave has been weakened."
    "你看得出来，洞穴中央的屏障已经减弱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_4ed929b4:

    # "Your health has also been replenished."
    "你的生命值也恢复了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_12679b39:

    # "There is a green gem on the pillar, it seems to be emanating dim light."
    "石柱上有一块绿宝石，似乎正散发着微弱的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_ace51061_2:

    # "You feel like you need to do something here to make it glow."
    "你感觉需要在这里做些什么，才能让它发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_7fe99247:

    # "The gem is glowing in bright green. You feel that this zone has been completed."
    "宝石正发出明亮的绿光，你感觉这个区域已经完成了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_50a4e009:

    # "The gem is glowing in bright blue. You feel that this zone has been completed."
    "宝石正发出明亮的蓝光，你感觉这个区域已经完成了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_f33a99aa:

    # "You look at the statue of minotaur, it seems to be pondering something..."
    "你望向弥诺陶洛斯的雕像，它似乎正在思索什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_6cf3c5ec:

    # "Surprisingly, it is extremely light, but you cannot lift it up."
    "出乎意料的是，它轻得惊人，可你却无法将它抬起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_b2df3c9f:

    # "Maybe you can push it around."
    "或许你可以推动它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_65150fdf:

    # "You notice the writing on the wall of stone in front of you..."
    "你注意到面前石墙上的文字……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_6ec44742:

    # "When you investigate on these words, you realise it is a riddle... or poem."
    "你仔细研究这些文字后，意识到那是个谜语……或者一首诗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_c64c694f:

    # "The riddle reads..."
    "谜语写道……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_dfec2fde:

    # "'O, Fearless, Intrepid Challenger. Standing in the Dungeon of the Mythical Creature.'"
    "“哦，无畏的勇敢挑战者，正站在神兽的地牢之中。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_32e4a775:

    # "'In order to remove the Barrier, Five tests of attributes he must clear. '"
    "“欲破屏障，须通过五项属性试炼。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_7b79a8b5:

    # "'A Test of Strength, a Case of Symmetry.'"
    "“一试力量，对称之题。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_a29d5750:

    # "'Restore the Balance, Solve the Mystery.'"
    "“恢复平衡，解开谜题。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_7c906dc9:

    # "'A Test of Agility, a Delivery of the Creature's Mold.'"
    "“敏捷试炼，护送神兽之像。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_8f91b678:

    # "'Watch your foothold for with every step, Death Tolls.'"
    "“步步看清落脚处，死亡钟声响起。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_cf588148:

    # "'A Test of Charisma, Yet a Trial It is Not to be.'"
    "“魅力试炼，却并非一场考验。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_83e249b9:

    # "'A record of the Creature's History. An Act of Charity to Thee.'"
    "“神兽往事之录，予你的一次善举。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_8f6dcbfc:

    # "'A Test of Tenacity, a Challenge for he to Toil and Suffer.'"
    "“坚毅试炼，令其劳作并承受苦难的挑战。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_af3dbc92:

    # "'A cue for Dangerous Encounters. To proceed, he must appear the Victor.'"
    "危险遭遇的提示。若要继续，他必须成为胜者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_285ed0e4:

    # "'A Test of Intelligence, a Puzzle, a Ritual Interrupted.'"
    "智慧试炼，一道谜题，一场被打断的仪式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_26d4582c:

    # "'The Casts' Placement be Corrected. The Runes thus Activated.'"
    "雕像的位置被摆正，符文随之激活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_7f1651e5:

    # "'Five Tests if proved Trifling, The barrier He Shall see Weakening.'"
    "五项试炼若都显得微不足道，屏障便会逐渐削弱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_76a84008:

    # "'The beast, the bull, the man is awaiting.'"
    "野兽、公牛与人正在等待。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_63298327:

    # "'A reward or a penalty?'"
    "是奖赏，还是惩罚？"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_e3dc0181:

    # "'Either a bull's spirit shall bent or remain unchallenged in victory."
    "公牛之魂要么屈服，要么在胜利中保持无人能敌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_f33a99aa_1:

    # "You look at the statue of minotaur, it seems to be pondering something..."
    "你看着弥诺陶洛斯雕像，它似乎正在思索什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_b2047690:

    # "The weight of the statue grows heavier as it glows bright blue."
    "雕像发出明亮蓝光的同时，重量变得更沉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_3d804a01:

    # "You look at the statue of minotaur, it seems to be ready to run..."
    "你看着弥诺陶洛斯雕像，它似乎正准备奔跑……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_64f1328b:

    # "With the material it is made of, you feel like it is about to crumble..."
    "从它所用的材质来看，你感觉它就要崩塌了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_c39b4b4c:

    # "You feel like you need to put something here..."
    "你感觉这里似乎需要放上什么东西……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_c39b4b4c_1:

    # "You feel like you need to put something here..."
    "你感觉这里似乎需要放上什么东西……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_3c33322e_3:

    # "As soon as you touch the gem. It instantly convulses."
    "你一碰宝石，它便立刻剧烈抽搐起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_961543e3_2:

    # "The gem seems to react to your placement of statue."
    "宝石似乎对你放置雕像的举动产生了反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_cca10e64:

    # "In a few seconds, the gem glows in bright yellow."
    "几秒后，宝石发出明亮的黄色光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_fa906442_3:

    # "You can tell that the barrier at the center of the cave has been weakened."
    "你能看出洞穴中央的屏障已经削弱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_d3f36a6a:

    # "There is a yellow gem on the pillar, it seems to be emanating dim light."
    "石柱上有一块黄色宝石，似乎正散发着微弱的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_ace51061_3:

    # "You feel like you need to do something here to make it glow."
    "你感觉需要在这里做些什么，才能让它发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_a531c3be:

    # "There is a pink gem on the pillar, it seems to be emanating dim light."
    "石柱上有一块粉色宝石，似乎正散发着微弱的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_ace51061_4:

    # "You feel like you need to do something here to make it glow."
    "你感觉需要在这里做些什么，才能让它发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_66298298:

    # "You look at the statue of minotaur, it seems to be grasping at its chest..."
    "你看着弥诺陶洛斯雕像，它似乎正抓着胸口……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_66298298_1:

    # "You look at the statue of minotaur, it seems to be grasping at its chest..."
    "你看着弥诺陶洛斯雕像，它似乎正抓着胸口……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_4bf69f5a:

    # "After admiring the bull, you notice there is a paragraph of what seems to be a riddle."
    "欣赏完这头公牛后，你注意到一段似乎是谜语的文字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_dacf5112:

    # "Encrypted on its chest."
    "胸口刻着密文。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_4dc279d7:

    # "The riddle writes:"
    "谜语上写着："

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_7ff59fd1:

    # "'A beast I have captured with sorcery and magic.'"
    "“我用妖术和魔法捕获了一头野兽。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_2647fb51:

    # "'The purpose? The Muscle, the Strength and the Meat.'"
    "“目的为何？肌肉、力量，还有肉体。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_5b1bd121:

    # "'The Minotaur proves to be highly energetic,'"
    "“弥诺陶洛斯精力旺盛，”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_cfb4d48c:

    # "'for its member rises hard and majestic.'"
    "“它的肉棒硬挺而雄伟。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_c7625ff0:

    # "'The length, I have admired, as it's tight and erotic.'"
    "“我欣赏它的长度，因为它紧实而淫靡。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_ef4ee773:

    # "'Though trapped, it is capable of actions malefic.'"
    "“虽被困住，它仍能做出邪恶之举。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_8c28617c:

    # "'Caution is advised or result might be tragic.'"
    "“务必小心，否则后果可能很惨烈。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_2f16831a:

    # "You are mildly shocked as to imagine the length of the minotaur described."
    "想象着诗中描写的弥诺陶洛斯的长度，你不禁有些震惊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_babd2917:

    # "Hard... and Majestic...? You drool at the thought of seeing it yourself."
    "坚硬……雄伟……？一想到能亲眼见到它，你就馋得流口水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_a4171e0e:

    # "Shaking away at your sexual thoughts, you notice another stanza under the riddle."
    "你摇摇头，甩开脑中的性念头，注意到谜语下方还有另一节诗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_f52b744c:

    # "It writes:"
    "上面写着："

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_a1094ef2:

    # "'Alluring Lust:'"
    "“魅惑之欲：”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_abe201d1:

    # "'A tactic to make a battle easier, a skill to make the enemies' digits harder.'"
    "“让战斗更轻松的战术，让敌人的命根子变硬的技能。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_3795dcd0:

    # "'Focus on your core and center, this is a charm and flirt enhancer.'"
    "“专注于你的核心与中心，这是增强魅力和调情效果的法术。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_78882d14:

    # "'The Minotaur cannot be defeated with pure power, instead focus on awakening its member.'"
    "“弥诺陶洛斯不是单靠蛮力就能击败的，应当转而专注于唤醒它的肉棒。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_fc0d911e:

    # "You feel your mind is suddenly filled with the power of ancient knowledge."
    "你感觉脑海中突然充满了古老知识的力量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_662fd9e4:

    # "In mere seconds, you have learnt a new ability... All-luring... Lust?"
    "短短几秒，你就学会了一个新技能……全方位诱惑……欲望？"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_1e08161a:

    # msg "A new ability has been added to your skill menu."
    msg "新技能已加入技能菜单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_f0ff827c:

    # "You turn around and see the pink gem convulses."
    "你转过身，看到粉色宝石正在抽搐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_2aab7cf7:

    # "The gem seems to react to your newly acquired ability."
    "宝石似乎对你新获得的能力产生了反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_b5af4c23:

    # "In a few seconds, the gem glows in bright pink."
    "几秒钟后，宝石绽放出耀眼的粉色光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_fa906442_4:

    # "You can tell that the barrier at the center of the cave has been weakened."
    "你看得出来，洞穴中央的屏障已经削弱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_f77fef43:

    # "Now that the statue is on the stand, you just need to activate the gem."
    "雕像已经放到台座上了，现在你只需要激活宝石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_3d804a01_1:

    # "You look at the statue of minotaur, it seems to be ready to run..."
    "你看着这尊弥诺陶洛斯雕像，它似乎已经准备好奔跑了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_25a490fc:

    # "The statue is glowing in yellow, and most importantly, it hardens enough to not ever crumble anymore."
    "雕像正发出黄色光芒，更重要的是，它已经坚固到再也不会崩塌了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_bfb7712a:

    # "The gem is glowing in bright pink. You feel that this zone has been completed."
    "宝石正绽放出明亮的粉色光芒。你感觉这个区域已经完成了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_aeb54c27:

    # "The gem is glowing in bright yellow. You feel that this zone has been completed."
    "宝石正绽放出明亮的黄色光芒。你感觉这个区域已经完成了。"

translate schinese_rewrite maze_figurine_in_crater_15d1e84b:

    # "You look at the tiny statue of a minotaur, it seems to be flexing its muscles."
    "你看着这座小小的弥诺陶洛斯雕像，它似乎正在绷紧肌肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite maze_figurine_in_crater_343280fd:

    # "It seems that the statue can be easily taken out of the crater..."
    "看起来，这尊雕像可以轻松地从坑里搬出来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Limestone_71a2792e:

    # "You stare at the chasm, it seems to be a weakpoint to extract some limestone."
    "你凝视着那道裂隙，它似乎是开采石灰岩的薄弱点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Limestone_f3b1df18:

    # "However, you do not have the specific tool to get them out."
    "不过，你没有合适的工具把它们弄出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Limestone_f43018cd:

    # "You take out your pickaxe and start striking it against the chasm."
    "你拿出镐，开始用它敲击那道裂隙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Limestone_0a549cff:

    # "After a few long and grueling moments, a small chunk of the limestone falls out of the wall."
    "经过漫长而艰苦的几番敲打，一小块石灰岩从墙上掉了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Limestone_8d7da241:

    # "There's nothing for you to mine for now... Maybe the ore will replenish... eventually."
    "现在已经没什么可挖的了……或许矿石最终会重新生成……"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Limestone_be847732:

    # "You have [item_number] limestones."
    "你有[item_number]块石灰岩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_TenStatue_518f3839:

    # "You run into the statue of minotaur in the cave, it seems to be resting, creating a strong barrier."
    "你在洞穴里撞见了弥诺陶洛斯雕像，它似乎正在休息，形成了一道坚固的屏障。"

translate schinese_rewrite maze_crater_e02b38e0:

    # "There is a crater in the ground..."
    "地上有一个坑……"

translate schinese_rewrite maze_crater_6f272596:

    # "It seems that you can fit the statue in your hand right inside."
    "看起来，这尊雕像正好能放进坑里，你一只手就能把它拿进去。"
